  "actualTrackingIssueBody": "# F042: JSON Patch dictionary replacement - measured no-gain\r\n\r\n**Tracking disposition, not a merge request.** Three completed source\r\ncomparisons retain all12profiles/576results. The declared parsed-object/1\r\nprimary takes3.65% more time at the median of paired effects; primary\r\nmanaged-byte savings are2,-1,2 B/op. Neither the predeclared5% timing nor\r\nrepeated16B saving criterion is met. No performance PR is created.\r\n\r\n| Artifact | Evidence |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Full explanation and connected artifacts | [Immutable evaluation](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/README.md) |\r\n| Actual experimental source, not recommended | [Commit737aae8](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/commit/737aae8c1a3de33f7474a2e19a26cb1b567f5290) |\r\n| Exact runnable BenchmarkDotNet project | [Project](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/harness/AutoPerf.Benchmarks.csproj) |\r\n| All comparisons, controls, allocations and variability | [Results](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/comparison-results.md) |\r\n| Exact commands and original/candidate tests | [Validation map](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/validation-commands.md) |\r\n| Independent arithmetic, runtime/source and relocation proof | [Auditor output](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/arithmetic-audit-003.stdout.txt), [independent rebuild](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/d06004a1d051d1118891c5bb80be8cb54fb763e3/F042/reproduction-paired-001/verified-reproduction.json) |\r\n\r\nActual JSON converters can resize or clear/repopulate the same dictionary.\r\nA borrowed reference cannot span that conversion. The guarded non-null,\r\nalready-assignable exact-dictionary candidate preserves the original\r\nconversion fallback and all34selected tests per source, including both real\r\nconverter-mutation theory rows. Current default, original, candidate and\r\nindependently rebuilt project characterizations pass all16public-producer\r\ncases and12untimed profiles.\r\n\r\nThis is not a semantic-bug fix, a32B allocation-saving claim, an isolated\r\nlookup or application-performance result, or complete compiler provenance.\r\nShared-VM adverse/control observations, actual preparation/audit failures,\r\nSourceLink precommit boundary and one descriptive byte-count correction are\r\nexplicitly retained. Three of three authorizations are consumed; no retiming.\r\nThe positive-findings report intentionally excludes no-gain cases.\n\nThe immutable evidence snapshot predates its additive publication receipt. Use the [current case guide](https://github.com/jaslawinMs/aspnetcore/blob/autoperf-results/F042/README.md) for that late receipt; the source, full results, tests and file manifest remain pinned above. No sealed evidence is rewritten to add tracking metadata.\n",
